	  <li>Skin_Locust_palee</li>
	  <li>Skin_Locust_paleee</li>
	  <li>Skin_Locust_paleeee</li>
    </genes>
  </XenotypeDef>
  
  <XenotypeDef>
    <defName>Locust_Kantus</defName>
    <label>Kantus</label>
    <description>The Kantus Priesthood, a mysterious order within the Locust Horde that is the subject of many rumors and theories but one thing is for certain, they take great pride in the power they wield over the Horde. Even the most cruel and foolish of Locust Queens value the wisdom of the Kantus, with many of them often holding positions on the Locust Council.</description>
    <descriptionShort>Kantus are a mysterious and vastly more intelligent breed of Locust.</descriptionShort>
    <iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/GOW_Kantus</iconPath>
    <inheritable>true</inheritable>
    <chanceToUseNameMaker>1</chanceToUseNameMaker>
    <genes>
	  <li MayRequire="RedMattis.BetterPrerequisites">Body_MaleOnly</li>
	  <li>GOW_LocustKantus</li>
	  <li>GOW_LocustMental</li>
